'''Difficulty:''' ★★★☆☆

'''Battle:''' Stack a few Slapstick Cats on the Sir Rels, then go on full offense with Royal Guard Cats. It is of utmost importance to time your Jelly Dumpling Cats to the best of your abilities, since the Capies are high-priority threats that need to be taken out before they stack. It is recommended to time them just as Evil Emperor Cat attacks so that they reach the frontlines as the subsequent Surge Attack concludes.

You'll be looking to create some distance between the frontlines and the Cat Base. The more room you have to work with, the less of a problem Oldhorn eventually becomes. Once he's dead, however, there's nothing the remaining supports can do to stop your inevitable advance.

