'''Difficulty:''' ★★☆☆☆

'''Battle:''' Save up for Idi:N2 and instantly deploy her when you get the chance. With the help of one Riceball Cat, she singlehandedly takes care of all the peons and occasionally sneaks in a hit or two on Sir Seal before dying. As the Red enemies approach, start spamming Gato Amigos and Roe Cat, then send out Esoteric Uril. Uril is going to be your main carry here, so you ''must'' protect him at all costs. His Strong/Slow/Curse abilities against Relics as well as Surge Immunity enable him to damage, stall and tank Evil Emperor while removing his Curse/Freeze. Riceball Cat is vital as a distraction that redirects hits away from your Roe Cats after Evil Emperor attacks. In tandem with Gato Amigo, this is the only source of defense you really need to outlast the enemies and eventually get a second Esoteric Uril out on the field. At that point, it's wraps for the enemies.

