==Trivia==
*The background used in this stage was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]], but was unimplemented and had a color scheme closer to that of [[Saint Red Fox]]. [[File:Bg147.png|thumb|right|Older Prelude to Ruin background]]
**Incidentally, 10.0 was the same update that added [[Dawn of the Beginning]], whose Japanese name is the opposite of [[Dead End Night]]'s, along with placeholders for [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]], who was an unnamed [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]], and Evil Emperor Cat, then named コニャンダム亜種 ''Ko Nyandamu Ashu'' ("[[Li'l Nyandam (Enemy)|Li'l Nyandam]] Variant").
*The "Demon King" (魔王 ''Maō'') mentioned in the Japanese name of this stage, Possessed by the Demon King, could be an allusion to [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Mystic Uril]]'s description which mentions Uril himself sealing away a Demon King. This Demon King likely refers to [[Infernal Tyrant Nyandam]], an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy titled "Great Demon King" in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]].
*Prior to [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2.1]], this stage had one less Capy, fewer Sir Rels and earlier enemy spawns.

